    {
      "sourceRequirementId": "SECTION-output",
      "sourceAnchor": "L361/## 9. 审核结果、问题码、分项与整案聚合",
      "sourceExcerpt": "## 9. 审核结果、问题码、分项与整案聚合\n\n### 9.1 三层状态必须独立\n\n- **证据/规则检查态** `CheckState`：`PASS, FAIL, NOT_APPLICABLE, NOT_DUE, CONDITION_UNKNOWN, NEEDS_SUPPLEMENT, FACT_CONFLICT, EXTERNAL_UNVERIFIED, POLICY_UNRESOLVED, AUTHORITY_PENDING, HUMAN_REVIEW, NOT_RUN, TECHNICAL_FAILURE`。`FAIL`表示**符合当前适用政策且有证据的负向事实**，不是正式学校驳回；`TECHNICAL_FAILURE`不能被转换成申请方过错。\n- **行级预审态** `LinePrecheck`：`PRECHECK_ELIGIBLE, PRECHECK_PARTIAL, PRECHECK_INELIGIBLE, PRECHECK_PENDING, OUT_OF_SCOPE`。",
